==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} {{term|wintbrawa|wintbrāwa|lang=goh}}. It has been theorised that it may be cognate with Old Prussian {{term|wanso||first hairs on the face|lang=prg}} and thence with Russian {{term|усы||tr=usy||moustache|lang=ru}}.

